```wireframe
board "Chat"
  screen phone
    navbar "John Smith" leading=back actions=[call, info]
    stack grow padding=12 gap=8 justify=end
      text "Today" muted size=sm align=center
      stack
        text "Hi there!" muted size=sm
      stack row justify=end
        text "Hey! How are you?" size=sm
      stack
        text "Doing great, thanks for asking" muted size=sm
      text "14:32" muted size=sm align=center
      stack row justify=end
        text "Want to grab coffee?" size=sm
    stack row padding=12 gap=8
      input placeholder="Type a message..." grow
      button ghost icon=send
```
